# Not ours to format.
node_modules/
.venv/
audit-out/
frappe_ai/public/dist/

# Prettier owns the languages .pre-commit-config.yaml already gave it: javascript, ts,
# vue, css, scss. Everything below keeps the owner it already has, or has none yet;
# widening Prettier's reach is a separate decision, not part of adopting it.
#
# Markdown: markdownlint (.markdownlint.json, run in CI) owns it, and Prettier would
# re-pad every table cell it lints.
*.md
# YAML: no style is declared for it, and reflowing a workflow file is not a format fix.
*.yml
*.yaml
# JSON: Frappe rewrites the DocType and workspace schemas on every save, and
# .editorconfig keeps JSON without a final newline, which Prettier always adds.
*.json
